-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 7.5.2015 — הרפורמה במכללות האקדמיות לחינוך: the
-- agreement between the State and הסתדרות המורים on the reform of the
-- teaching staff of the colleges of education, registered on 21.7.2015
-- (no. 125/2015). The corpus holds it in part: the scan passes from the
-- end of the preamble to §5(ב), so §§1–4 and §5(א) — the grant's amount
-- and its period — are missing, and again from the middle of §6(ה) to §8,
-- so the rest of §6(ה) and all of §7 are. What it holds: the grant's rules
-- (§5(ב)–(ח)), the 10% reform supplement from 1.9.2014 (§6), the 6% of the
-- cost frame left for the colleges' new structure (§8), the union's consent
-- (§9), the negotiation still to come (§10), the procedure for ending
-- employment (§11), §90 of the agreement of 29.2.2012 set aside (§12),
-- exhaustion of claims, industrial peace and earlier terms (§§13–15).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT minimum_wage_law

§ `הסכם קיבוצי מיום 7.5.2015 — הרפורמה במכללות האקדמיות לחינוך`

-- akn:preamble/p1 The Registrar's stamp: registered on 21.7.2015, number 125/2015; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 The agreement's title and its day of signing, written in by hand (7/5/15); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 The parties: the State, by the wages commissioner and the Ministry of Education's director-general, and הסתדרות המורים, by its secretary-general; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 A recital: the Ofek Hadash agreements of 10.9.2007, 25.12.2008 and 29.2.2012.
-- akn:preamble/p11 A recital: those of 25.12.2008 and 17.9.2013 left the colleges and seminaries of teacher training to a further agreement.
-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: a reform of the colleges, fitting their teaching staff to that of the academic colleges the Council for Higher Education recognises, keeping their own character.
-- akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 akn:preamble/p15 A recital of the negotiation and its cost frame, and the words of agreement; no rule.

`what the agreement of 7.5.2015 lacks` MEANS
    LIST `the text is missing` "סעיפים 1–4 וסעיף 5(א) (עמוד 1 עד תחילת עמוד 2 בסריקה): בין היתר סכום המענק ו\"התקופה\" שלו",
         `the text is missing` "המשך סעיף 6(ה) וסעיף 7 כולו (סוף עמוד 2 עד תחילת עמוד 3 בסריקה)"

-- akn:preamble/p16 The corpus's note that the scan passes from the end of the preamble to §5(ב), §§1–4 missing; stated above as what the agreement lacks.

§§ `5 מענק`

-- akn:art_5 The corpus's note that §5's number, heading and (א), which sets the grant, are missing; the number is read from the section's references to itself and from §10.

-- (ב): (א)'s amount is for a teacher employed in the colleges throughout
-- the period in a full position; one in a part position has it by his
-- weighted position over the period, at most 100%. (ג): one employed in
-- part of the period has the share he was employed. The amount and the
-- period are (א)'s, which the corpus lacks: inputs.
@ref akn:art_5__para_b akn:art_5__para_c
GIVEN `(א)'s amount` IS A NUMBER @desc the grant section 5(א) sets, which the corpus lacks
      `his weighted position over the period` IS A NUMBER
      `the share of the period he was employed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the colleges' grant of 7.5.2015` `(א)'s amount` `his weighted position over the period` `the share of the period he was employed` IS
    `(א)'s amount` TIMES (min `his weighted position over the period` 1) TIMES `the share of the period he was employed`

#ASSERT `the colleges' grant of 7.5.2015` 4000 1.2 0.5 EQUALS 2000

DECLARE `what the colleges' grant of 7.5.2015 might count for` IS ONE OF
    `salary for every purpose, colleges' grant`
    `severance pay, colleges' grant`
    `the hour value, colleges' grant`
    `provident-fund contributions, colleges' grant`
    `topping up to the minimum wage, colleges' grant`
    `the salary base and the base of supplements, colleges' grant`

-- (ד): not salary for every purpose, not counted for severance or the
-- hour value; (ה): no contribution to any provident fund on it (a study
-- fund, a pension fund, a fund not paying a pension); (ז): not counted
-- toward the minimum-wage top-up; (ח): it changes no teacher's salary base
-- on the eve of the signing and is in the base of no supplement.
@ref akn:art_5__para_d akn:art_5__para_e akn:art_5__para_g akn:art_5__para_h
GIVEN p IS A `what the colleges' grant of 7.5.2015 might count for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the colleges' grant of 7.5.2015 counts for` p IF
    FALSE

-- (ו): it is paid also for an absence the employer pays salary for, out of
-- his own funds (paid training, mourning, reserve duty), or leave or sick
-- pay and the like; not for an absence paid nothing.
@ref akn:art_5__para_f
GIVEN `the absence was paid by the employer, or as leave or sick pay` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an absence counts toward the colleges' grant of 7.5.2015` `the absence was paid by the employer, or as leave or sick pay` IF
    `the absence was paid by the employer, or as leave or sick pay`

-- Against the Minimum Wage Law's floor (MMS-601): (ז) leaves the grant out
-- of the pay that counts toward the top-up; leaving it out makes the
-- top-up the law's or more (its §11). Checked on a month's figures as if
-- §3 counted it (a fixed supplement for the work), the strictest case.
#ASSERT NOT `counting a component as the instrument does falls below the Minimum Wage Law` 5300 4800 (`component paid in the month under the Minimum Wage Law` `a fixed supplement paid for the work, under section 3(ב)(3)` 300) (`the colleges' grant of 7.5.2015 counts for` `topping up to the minimum wage, colleges' grant`)

§§ `6 תוספת רפורמה`

-- (א): from 1.9.2014, 10% of the cost frame goes to a wage supplement, and
-- the teachers the agreement covers have a supplement of 10% from that day
-- ("תוספת רפורמה"). (ב): computed on the combined salary and the 2001,
-- 2008 and 2011 supplements.
@ref akn:art_6__para_a akn:art_6__para_b
GIVEN `the combined salary and the 2001, 2008 and 2011 supplements` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the colleges' reform supplement of 7.5.2015` `the combined salary and the 2001, 2008 and 2011 supplements` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2014)
    THEN `the combined salary and the 2001, 2008 and 2011 supplements` TIMES 10%
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `the colleges' reform supplement of 7.5.2015` 9000 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2014) EQUALS 900
#ASSERT `the colleges' reform supplement of 7.5.2015` 9000 (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2014) EQUALS 0

DECLARE `what the colleges' reform supplement of 7.5.2015 might count for` IS ONE OF
    `the hour value, colleges' reform supplement`
    `severance pay, colleges' reform supplement`
    `pension contributions for an accruing pension, colleges' reform supplement`
    `the study fund, colleges' reform supplement`
    `percentage supplements on the combined salary but the 2001, 2008 and 2011 ones, colleges' reform supplement`
    `the 2001, 2008 and 2011 supplements, colleges' reform supplement`

-- (ג): a separate salary component, counted for the hour value,
-- severance, pension contributions (an accruing pension), the study fund
-- and the percentage supplements on the combined salary but the 2001, 2008
-- and 2011 ones. Of the minimum wage it says nothing: the supplement is a
-- monthly percentage of the salary, which the law's §3(ב)(3) counts as it
-- stands (convention instruments.minimum-wage-fixed-supplement).
@ref akn:art_6__para_c
GIVEN p IS A `what the colleges' reform supplement of 7.5.2015 might count for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the colleges' reform supplement of 7.5.2015 counts for` p IF
    NOT p EQUALS `the 2001, 2008 and 2011 supplements, colleges' reform supplement`

-- (ד): the 1987 and 1994 supplements are raised by 10%, on their shekel
-- value on the eve of the signing.
@ref akn:art_6__para_d
GIVEN `the supplement on the eve of 7.5.2015` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1987 or 1994 supplement after 7.5.2015` `the supplement on the eve of 7.5.2015` IS
    `the supplement on the eve of 7.5.2015` TIMES 1.1

#ASSERT `the 1987 or 1994 supplement after 7.5.2015` 200 EQUALS 220

-- (ה): the parties will discuss how the reform supplement is counted in
-- the determining salary for a pension, aiming at what they did for the
-- teaching employees' determining salary — the sentence breaks off where
-- the scan does (`what the agreement of 7.5.2015 lacks`).
@ref akn:art_6__para_e
DECLARE `colleges' reform action of 7.5.2015` IS ONE OF
    `discuss the reform supplement in the determining salary`
    `allocate the remaining 6% to the colleges' new structure`
    `cooperate with the colleges' structural changes`
    `negotiate the colleges' new terms within the rest of the frame`
    `negotiate dividing the cost left after the grant, for retirement`
    `strike, lock out or disrupt work over what the agreement of 7.5.2015 settles`

`discussing the reform supplement in the determining salary` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `discuss the reform supplement in the determining salary`

-- akn:art_6__para_e/p2 The corpus's note that the rest of §6(ה) and all of §7 are missing; stated above as what the agreement lacks.

§§ `8 הקצאת יתרת העלות`

-- §8: the rest of the cost, 6% of the frame, is allocated to changes in
-- the colleges' pay and employment structure, fitting it to the academic
-- colleges', keeping their own character.
@ref akn:art_8/p1
`the share of the frame left for the colleges' structure` MEANS 6%

`allocating the colleges' remaining 6%` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `allocate the remaining 6% to the colleges' new structure`

#ASSERT 10% PLUS `the share of the frame left for the colleges' structure` EQUALS 16%

§§ `9 הסכמת הסתדרות המורים`

-- §9: the union accepts the structural and organisational changes and
-- undertakes to cooperate in carrying them out.
@ref akn:art_9
`cooperating with the colleges' changes` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    MUST  `cooperate with the colleges' structural changes`

§§ `10 משא ומתן`

-- ¶1: soon after the signing the parties negotiate an agreement on the
-- colleges' new terms within the rest of the frame (§4, which the corpus
-- lacks). ¶2: for §5's period, they negotiate how the cost left after the
-- grant is divided; it goes to retirement plans for the colleges' teachers.
@ref akn:art_10/p1 akn:art_10/p2
`negotiating the colleges' terms` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `negotiate the colleges' new terms within the rest of the frame`
    HENCE (PARTY `the State`
           MUST  `negotiate dividing the cost left after the grant, for retirement`)

§§ `11 נוהל סיום העסקה`

-- §11: from the agreement's start the Ministry's procedure of 7.5.15 on
-- ending employment in the colleges for administrative reasons applies to
-- their teachers (outside the corpus), and no other.
@ref akn:art_11/p1
`the colleges' procedure for ending employment is dated` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 7 5 2015

`why the colleges' procedure for ending employment is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "נוהל סיום העסקה במכללות האקדמיות לחינוך מטעמים מנהליים, מיום 7.5.15"

§§ `12 סעיף 90 להסכם 29.2.2012`

-- §12: §90 of the special agreement of 29.2.2012 does not apply to the
-- colleges' teachers.
@ref akn:art_12
`§90 of 29.2.2012 applies to a college's teacher` MEANS FALSE

§§ `13 מיצוי`

-- ¶1: the agreement exhausts the parties' claims on what it settles, the
-- cost frame among them; ¶2: it exhausts §90 of the special agreement
-- for the teachers it covers; ¶3: and the cost frame for the colleges'
-- reform under §155(ב) of the agreement of 25.12.2008.
-- F-michlalot-2015-a: ¶2 dates the special agreement 29.12.2012, where §12
-- dates the same agreement, the one whose §90 it sets aside, 29.2.2012; no
-- special agreement of 29.12.2012 is in the corpus. The reading adopted is
-- the agreement of 29.2.2012 (convention instruments.cited-instrument-misdated).
@ref akn:art_13/p1 akn:art_13/p2 akn:art_13/p3
`claims on the colleges' cost frame remain after 7.5.2015` MEANS FALSE

`the special agreement §12 names is of` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 29 2 2012
`the special agreement §13 names is printed of` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 29 12 2012

`§13 dates the special agreement otherwise than §12` MEANS
    NOT `the special agreement §13 names is printed of` EQUALS `the special agreement §12 names is of`
#ASSERT `§13 dates the special agreement otherwise than §12`

§§ `14 שקט תעשייתי`

-- §14: in the agreement's term, no strike, lockout or organised disruption
-- over what it settles, the colleges' new terms among it.
@ref akn:art_14/p1
`industrial peace of 7.5.2015` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `strike, lock out or disrupt work over what the agreement of 7.5.2015 settles`

§§ `15 תנאים קודמים`

-- §15: earlier terms stand unless this agreement amends or cancels them,
-- expressly or by implication.
@ref akn:art_15/p1
`earlier terms stand after 7.5.2015 unless amended` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:conclusions/p1 akn:conclusions/p2 akn:conclusions/t1 The signing formula and the parties' signatures; no rule.
